  "description": "What a great week in the markets! 🤯 So...what's next?!",
  "body_html": "<p>This week was incredible…every stock just seems to be going up! Even the apes 🦍 are making money right now. We have done the hard part…sitting out in the bad times, not DCA’ing and hemorrhaging portfolios and instead compounding winners. That said, lets cover a few topics going forward in preparation for the week ahead of us. </p><ul><li><p>Next Week Expectations</p></li><li><p>Jerome Powell Thoughts</p></li><li><p>My Stock Market Gameplan</p></li></ul><h4>Next Week Expectations (7/21)</h4><p>Trend is your friend. I am seeing many green traders trying to short right now. This goes against the trend. Wait until you see something “break”. Something “break” means that you start seeing a few popular, well known names just crash out of the blue. The primary examples we had a few months ago was Target and Dollar General. Both of them crashed ~30%. Those are, or were, considered credible names, especially with the thought they are recession resistant. Obviously not. <em><strong>I have no idea what the names will be, or when they will occur. But that is the #1 signal I am looking for to really start taking profits off the table</strong></em>. </p><p>The VIX continues to trend downwards, along with the dollar. This is prime conditions for us to continue along with our bullish trajectory (assuming nothing crazy happens this weekend like WW3!). <em><strong>My not financial advice is: stick with longs. They are working. </strong></em></p><p>Whatever you do…keep a calm, collected mindset. Do not let your wins drive your ego up. The market loves to humble all. No idea how long this bull trend will last, my best guess is maybe 1 or 2 months?! But blow off tops can last shorter or longer as well. I see a lot of resemblance to 1987 Japan blow off top…more to come on that later. Whenever it ends, a period of mass euphoria is balanced with a period of troughs of depression. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1084\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1084,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Newtonʻs 3 Laws of Motion — Jolie Canoli&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Newtonʻs 3 Laws of Motion — Jolie Canoli&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Newtonʻs 3 Laws of Motion — Jolie Canoli\" title=\"Newtonʻs 3 Laws of Motion — Jolie Canoli\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dQol!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33109375-e60a-4ede-923a-2ab0cbfccf0d_2500x1862.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Newtons 3rd Law: Every action has an equal and opposite reaction. The same applies for the markets. Periods of peak euphoria are countered later with troughs of depression. </figcaption></figure></div><h4>Jerome Powell Thoughts</h4><p>I agree with the sentiment that if Jerome Powell was removed, it would be devastating to the markets. He is a force of predictability and stability…something markets love.  Although, I find it very unlikely he will be removed…I cannot guarantee it. If you didn’t see, be sure to check out my post about the allegations of <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-135892054\">Jerome Powell’s “$2.5B Palace Spending Spree”</a> is just a political smear campaign. My expectations is the Trump Administration will take him to court, and lose. I think it is something to monitor…but nothing to get wound up about. Just my opinion. .</p><h4>My Stock Market Gameplan</h4><p>I put out an explicit <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/next-stock-market-moves?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Gameplan in this post</a></strong>. Forewarning, its not “exhilarating”. Largely, I will continue to play individual positions with popular, but overlooked, names…mostly originating from the StockTok Screener. When I start to notice many positions getting stopped out, or setups not working, I will begin scaling out. Again, no idea how long this trend will last…we play until the market starts winning!</p><p>I think 99% of the members are currently in; if you have any issues, feel free to DM me. Inputting your email and selecting “forgot password”, to receive a link to create a new password has gotten 100% of users into <a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard.com</a>. We expected a little chaos the first week getting people in, but it wasn’t too bad. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RvSs!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b2ba3a8-620d-48c0-a290-1bd08c1506df_1899x976.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RvSs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b2ba3a8-620d-48c0-a290-1bd08c1506df_1899x976.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RvSs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b2ba3a8-620d-48c0-a290-1bd08c1506df_1899x976.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RvSs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b2ba3a8-620d-48c0-a290-1bd08c1506df_1899x976.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!RvSs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6b2b